description:
***This is us***
 At Avenga, we believe that human creativity empowers technology that matters. Operating globally, our 6000\+ specialists provide a full spectrum of services, including business and tech advisory, enterprise solutions, CX, UX, and UI design, managed services, product development, and software development.




***This is the job***
 We are looking for a
 **Senior AI Engineer** 
 to join our team in collaboration with an innovative American client. As a Senior AI Engineer, you’ll have the autonomy to shape the core technology powering next\-generation news platforms, directly influencing how news is aggregated and understood at scale.




 Ready for the next step in your AI career? We’d love to meet you!




***This is you***
* 5\+ years of experience in Python back\-end development;
* Proven experience in web scraping and data extraction with tools such as BeautifulSoup, Scrapy, or similar;
* Good knowledge of NLP techniques and deploying/using transformer\-based on\-prem models (e.g., Qwen, BERT);
* Experience applying AI/ML methods for content translation, clustering, and summarization;
* Strong understanding of REST APIs, asynchronous processing, and distributed systems;
* Comfortable using PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, and Git.
* Experience with dockerizing solutions and deploying to on\-premises infrastructure (Kubernetes clusters);
* English: Upper\-intermediate or higher.


**Nice\-to\-have Skills**
* Experience working with multilingual datasets.


***This is your role***
* Design and develop scalable web scraping pipelines using BeautifulSoup, Requests, and/or Selenium;
* Implement content extraction and noise reduction logic for both structured and unstructured web data;
* Integrate AI components for: translation, content categorization, clustering of similar news items, summarization (with preference for Qwen 32B model);
* Build pipelines to de\-duplicate and normalize multilingual news content;
* Collaborate with AI/ML engineers to optimize model inference performance and ensure efficient data flow;
* Design APIs and back\-end infrastructure to deliver aggregated news content to end\-users;
* Monitor and maintain scrapers, adapting to site structure changes and ensuring data quality and integrity;
* Write clean, maintainable, and testable code, actively contributing to a collaborative team environment.


***What awaits you at Avenga?***
 Through our values, Better Minds, Bolder Ideas, and Bigger Hearts, we strive to provide you with the tools, autonomy, trust, and assistance you need to excel. Enjoy benefits like private health insurance, well\-being programs, flexible and hybrid work models, laptops and gear, training, language classes, social events, great offices, and more.




*We take pride in the diverse skills and character of our teams, welcoming everyone to apply and contribute to our collective strength* 
 .

We are looking for AI/ML Consultants, who wants to work for the European Institutions in Brussels.




 We are looking for a senior IT consultant with at least 1 year of ML, NLP, AI experience with Python or Java in a cloud environment










 Candidates need to be based in Belgium or willing to relocate to Brussels when coming from abroad.










 EU candidates are welcome to apply. Work permit is not provided.










 This position is also open for employees and freelancers. Candidates need to be fluent in English.










**Tasks and responsibilities** 



* Develop and maintain software applications in Natural Language Processing (NLP), Machine Learning (ML), and Artificial Intelligence (AI);
* Design and optimize machine learning systems and deep learning architectures;
* Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to integrate AI/ML solutions into existing products and processes;
* Define and implement IT architectures for NLP, ML, and AI solutions, ensuring alignment with master and meta\-data management concepts;
* Perform data preprocessing, feature engineering, and model evaluation to enhance performance;
* Stay updated with the latest advancements in AI/ML technologies and algorithms;
* Maintain and support AI\-deployed solutions on SaaS platforms such as AWS and Azure;
* Document architecture blueprints and align them with business requirements;









**Profile:** 



* Master or Bachelor degree;
* \+13 years of general IT experience.
* \+1 year of experience with Large Language Models (LLMs), text embeddings, tokenization, vectorization, machine learning, and deep learning;
* \+1 year of experience with of Python/Java/Containers (Docker/Kubernetes)/Cloud AI services (AWS, Azure);
* \+1 year of experience in the full lifecycle of natural language processing (NLP) systems and agile software development methodologies;
* \+1 year of experience in quality assurance and quality control for machine translation (MT), and experience with MT quality procedures, testing methodologies and tools, such as automatic quality metrics (BLEU scores and similar) and human evaluation of MT quality;
* Proven ability to conduct proof of concepts (PoCs) efficiently and effectively;
* Strong presentation skills for both technical and business audiences;
* High attention to quality standards and the ability to work in fast\-evolving cloud\-based environments;
* Strong written communication skills for technical documentation;
* Ability to actively participate in technical discussions and collaborate with diverse stakeholders;
* Fluent in English;



 Desirable Certifications (one or more of the following certifications are preferred):



* AWS Certifications: AWS Certified Machine Learning, AWS Certified Data Analytics, AWS Certified Solutions Architect;
* Microsoft Certifications: Azure AI Engineer Associate, Azure Data Scientist Associate, Azure Solutions Architect Expert;
